      2 <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_1
    value: "<size=32><style=coinColor>WILD SUBSTITUTES \nFOR ALL SYMBOLS\nEXCEPT SCATTER"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_3
    value: <style=title><size=42>LINES
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_4
    value: <style=title><size=42>GAME RULES
  - key: PAYTABLE_SCATTER_SYMBOL_SUB_TITLE
    value: <b><size=24><color=#fc9109>PAYS   FREE SPINS
  - key: PAYTABLE_SCATTER_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT_TEXT
    value: '<b><size=32>5

      4

      3'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SCATTER_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: '<b><size=24><style=coinColor>{2:CommaNumber}</style>

      <style=coinColor>{1:CommaNumber}</style>

      <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SCATTER_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FREE_SPINS
    value: '<b><size=24><style=coinColor> 20</style>

      <style=coinColor> 15</style>

      <style=coinColor> 10</style></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_4
    value: "<size=22>- All wins pay LEFT to RIGHT on adjacent reels, beginning with
      leftmost reel, \n   except scatters.\n- All wins are paid on lines played, except
      scatters, which are added to line wins. \n- Highest win paid on any played line,
      except scatters. \n- All wins are multiplied by the number of coins bet per
      line, except scatters."
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_LINES
    value: <style=title><size=42>LINES
  - key: PAYTABLE_WAY_INFO
    value: <size=24><color=#00eaff>25 LINES</color></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_BET_INFO
    value: '<size=24><color=#00eaff>Bet Per Line: 1</color></size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_0
    value: <style=title><size=32>SCATTER</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_0
    value: "<size=19>SCATTERS pay in any position. \nScatter wins are multiplied by\n
      total wager."
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_1
    value: <style=title><size=32>WILD</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_1
    value: "<size=19>WILDS substitute for all symbols, \nexcept SCATTERS. \nWhen one
      or more WILDS substitute \nin a win, highest win is paid."
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_3
    value: <size=24>3 or more SCATTERS will trigger the Showtime Free Spin Bonus Feature
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_5
    value: "<size=19>- Player will be awarded 10 free spins.\n- During the free spin
      feature all wilds will expand to fill the entire reel.\n- Getting 3 or more
      scatters during the free spins will retrigger the Bonus Feature awarding 10\n
      \ more free spins to the free spin total.\n- Coin bets are lines played are
      the same as the game that triggered the Free Spin Bonus feature."
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_7
    value: <style=title><size=42>FEATURE</size>
